					<div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description panel entry-content wc-tab" id="tab-description" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-description">
				
	<h2>Description</h2>

<p><strong>TV Mount Installation Services in Toronto</strong></p>
<p>Looking to give your living room a fresh look? Our TV mount installation service is here to help! At Supply Toronto Inc., we specialize in securely mounting TVs of all sizes, ensuring you get the perfect viewing experience without the clutter of wires.</p>
<h3>What We Do:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Secure Mounting:</strong> Our skilled team will carefully mount your TV on any wall type—drywall, brick, or concrete—while ensuring it’s securely fastened to the stud for safety.</li>
<li><strong>Leveling:</strong> We make sure your TV is perfectly level, so it looks great on the wall.</li>
<li><strong>Flexible Scheduling:</strong> We know life can be busy! Let us know what times work best for you, and we’ll do our best to accommodate.</li>
<li><strong>Cable Management:</strong> We offer internal and external cable management for an extra charge. Please note that the cost of supplies will be at the customer’s expense.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Pricing:</h3>
<p>For TVs ranging from <strong>32&#8243; to 65&#8243;</strong>, the installation price is <strong>$98</strong>. For TVs larger than <strong>65&#8243;</strong>, please email us at <strong><a rel="noopener"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="650c0b030a2516101515091c310a170a0b110a4b0604">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></strong> or fill out the form below for a custom quote.</p>
<h3>Warranty:</h3>
<p>We offer a <strong>1-year warranty</strong> on all TV mount installations, giving you peace of mind and ensuring long-lasting quality.</p>
<h3>Why Choose Us?</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Experienced Team:</strong> Our friendly professionals are dedicated to getting the job done right and ensuring you’re happy with the results.</li>
<li><strong>Local Knowledge:</strong> As a Toronto-based company, we understand the ins and outs of the area and tailor our services to meet your needs.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Let’s Get Started!</h3>
<p>Ready to transform your space? Contact us to schedule your TV mount installation! Just share your TV size, wall type, and a few times that work for you, and we’ll take care of the rest.</p>
<p>Check out all our vanity sizes in one place: <a href="https://supplytoronto.ca/product/vanity/" target="_new" rel="noopener">Vanity Collection</a>. Also, take a look at our <a href="https://supplytoronto.ca/" target="_new" rel="noopener">Home Page</a> for more info and additional products.</p>
<p><a href="#form"><strong><span style="color: #ff0000;">Please fill out the form below</span></strong></a></p>
<p><a name="form"></a><br />
