<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@graph":[{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"name":"Home","@id":"https://supplytoronto.ca"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"name":"Bathroom Vanities","@id":"https://supplytoronto.ca/product-category/bathroom-vanities/"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"name":"Tv Mount Installation","@id":"https://supplytoronto.ca/product/tv-mount-installation/"}}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Product","@id":"https://supplytoronto.ca/product/tv-mount-installation/#product","name":"Tv Mount Installation","url":"https://supplytoronto.ca/product/tv-mount-installation/","description":"TV Mount Installation Services in Toronto\r\n\r\nLooking to give your living room a fresh look? Our TV mount installation service is here to help! At Supply Toronto Inc., we specialize in securely mounting TVs of all sizes, ensuring you get the perfect viewing experience without the clutter of wires.\r\nWhat We Do:\r\n\r\n \tSecure Mounting: Our skilled team will carefully mount your TV on any wall type\u2014drywall, brick, or concrete\u2014while ensuring it\u2019s securely fastened to the stud for safety.\r\n \tLeveling: We make sure your TV is perfectly level, so it looks great on the wall.\r\n \tFlexible Scheduling: We know life can be busy! Let us know what times work best for you, and we\u2019ll do our best to accommodate.\r\n \tCable Management: We offer internal and external cable management for an extra charge. Please note that the cost of supplies will be at the customer\u2019s expense.\r\n\r\nPricing:\r\nFor TVs ranging from 32\" to 65\", the installation price is $98. For TVs larger than 65\", please email us at info@supplyToronto.ca or fill out the form below for a custom quote.\r\nWarranty:\r\nWe offer a 1-year warranty on all TV mount installations, giving you peace of mind and ensuring long-lasting quality.\r\nWhy Choose Us?\r\n\r\n \tExperienced Team: Our friendly professionals are dedicated to getting the job done right and ensuring you\u2019re happy with the results.\r\n \tLocal Knowledge: As a Toronto-based company, we understand the ins and outs of the area and tailor our services to meet your needs.\r\n\r\nLet\u2019s Get Started!\r\nReady to transform your space? Contact us to schedule your TV mount installation! Just share your TV size, wall type, and a few times that work for you, and we\u2019ll take care of the rest.\r\n\r\nCheck out all our vanity sizes in one place: Vanity Collection. Also, take a look at our Home Page for more info and additional products.\r\n\r\nPlease fill out the form below\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.Name *FirstLastEmail *Phone Number *Type of Building *HouseCondo / ApartmentAddress *Postal Code *TV Size *32\" - 65\"+70\"Desired TimesAdditional DetailsPlease list several times that work for you for the installation (e.g., \"Monday after 5 PM, Tuesday morning, Wednesday afternoon\").Submit","image":"https://supplytoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/SupplyToronto-TV-mount-installation-Service-tv-mounting-service-in-GTA.jpeg","sku":2329,"offers":[{"@type":"Offer","priceSpecification":[{"@type":"UnitPriceSpecification","price":"50.00","priceCurrency":"CAD","validThrough":"2027-12-31","valueAddedTaxIncluded":false}],"priceValidUntil":"2027-12-31","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","url":"https://supplytoronto.ca/product/tv-mount-installation/","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Supply Toronto","url":"https://supplytoronto.ca"}}]}]}</script>	<script>
